{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 40, :comments ["<b>ישק</b> — twice: על פיך ישק (shall your mouth be kissed). The other: שפתים ישק משיב דברים נכוחים (lips kiss one who returns upright words). Because he returned upright words, he merited על פיך ישק כל עמי (shall all my people kiss your mouth)."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:09.986126489Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}